{
  "info": {
    "name": "SparkHire AI — Collection Complète v4",
    "description": "Collection complète pour tester toutes les routes de SparkHire AI.\n\n**Changelog v4 :**\n- `Question.max_duration_seconds` défaut = 90 s (1 min 30 s)\n- `Question.weight` défaut = 1.0 (moyenne pondérée)\n- `global_verdict` supprimé — remplacé par `average_score` + `decision`\n- Bouton réponse désactivé pendant lecture audio (activé après fin)\n- Compte à rebours 1:30 affiché pendant enregistrement\n- Welcome back si reconnexion sur session in_progress\n- followup_thanks supprimé sur la dernière question\n\n**Workflow :**\n1. Auth → Login\n2. Candidates → Create\n3. Positions → Create (weights + max_duration)\n4. Sessions → Create\n5. WebSocket → Entretien\n6. Evaluations → Get rapport\n7. Notifications → Vérifier",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",        "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",           "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "candidate_id",    "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "position_id",     "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "session_id",      "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "",                      "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "00 — Système",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Root",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "API Info",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/info" }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "01 — Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.access_token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.access_token); console.log('Token OK'); }"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "username", "value": "rh@stark.tn" },
              { "key": "password", "value": "admin123" }
            ]}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "02 — Candidates",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Candidate",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j._id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('candidate_id', j._id); console.log('candidate_id:', j._id); }"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/candidates/",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Ahmed\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Ben Ali\",\n  \"contact\": {\n    \"email\": \"ahmed.benali@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+216 55 123 456\",\n    \"linkedin\": \"https://linkedin.com/in/ahmedbenali\",\n    \"github\": \"https://github.com/ahmedbenali\"\n  },\n  \"technical_skills\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Python\",           \"level\": \"Advanced\",     \"years_experience\": 4 },\n    { \"name\": \"FastAPI\",          \"level\": \"Intermediate\", \"years_experience\": 2 },\n    { \"name\": \"MongoDB\",          \"level\": \"Intermediate\", \"years_experience\": 2 },\n    { \"name\": \"Machine Learning\", \"level\": \"Advanced\",     \"years_experience\": 3 },\n    { \"name\": \"Scikit-learn\",     \"level\": \"Advanced\",     \"years_experience\": 3 },\n    { \"name\": \"TensorFlow\",       \"level\": \"Intermediate\", \"years_experience\": 2 }\n  ],\n  \"experiences\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Data Scientist\",\n      \"company\": \"TechCorp Tunis\",\n      \"location\": \"Tunis\",\n      \"start_date\": \"2022-01\",\n      \"currently_working\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Développement de modèles ML pour la prédiction client\",\n      \"technologies\": [\"Python\", \"Scikit-learn\", \"TensorFlow\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"education\": [\n    {\n      \"degree\": \"Ingénieur\",\n      \"field\": \"Data Engineering & Systèmes Décisionnels\",\n      \"institution\": \"ENETCOM Sfax\",\n      \"start_date\": \"2020\",\n      \"end_date\": \"2023\",\n      \"currently_studying\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"languages\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Arabic\",  \"level\": \"Native\" },\n    { \"name\": \"French\",  \"level\": \"C1\" },\n    { \"name\": \"English\", \"level\": \"B2\" }\n  ],\n  \"soft_skills\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Teamwork\" },\n    { \"name\": \"Communication\" },\n    { \"name\": \"Problem Solving\" }\n  ],\n  \"certifications\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"AWS Certified Developer\",\n      \"issuer\": \"Amazon Web Services\",\n      \"issue_date\": \"2023-06\",\n      \"expiry_date\": \"2026-06\",\n      \"credential_id\": \"AWS-DEV-123456\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Candidates",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/candidates/?skip=0&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["candidates",""],
              "query": [{"key":"skip","value":"0"},{"key":"limit","value":"20"}]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Candidate by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/candidates/{{candidate_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Candidate (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/candidates/{{candidate_id}}",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"soft_skills\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Leadership\" },\n    { \"name\": \"Adaptability\" }\n  ]\n}", "options": {"raw":{"language":"json"}}}
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Candidate",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/candidates/{{candidate_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "03 — Positions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Position — Data Scientist ★ (weights + 90 s défaut)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j._id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('position_id', j._id);",
              "  console.log('position_id:', j._id);",
              "  j.questions.forEach(q => console.log(`  Q${q.order} weight=${q.weight} max=${q.max_duration_seconds}s : ${q.question_fr.substring(0,50)}`));",
              "}"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/positions",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Data Scientist\",\n  \"department\": \"Tech\",\n  \"location\": \"Sfax\",\n  \"is_active\": true,\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"weight\": 1.0,\n      \"max_duration_seconds\": 90,\n      \"question_ar\": \"أخبرني عن نفسك وعن تجربتك في علم البيانات.\",\n      \"question_fr\": \"Parlez-moi de vous et de votre expérience en data science.\",\n      \"question_en\": \"Tell me about yourself and your data science experience.\",\n      \"evaluation_criteria\": [\"clarté\", \"expérience pertinente\", \"motivation\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"weight\": 2.0,\n      \"max_duration_seconds\": 90,\n      \"question_ar\": \"ما هي أدوات تعلم الآلة التي استخدمتها؟ أعطني مثالاً.\",\n      \"question_fr\": \"Quels outils de machine learning avez-vous utilisés ? Donnez un exemple concret.\",\n      \"question_en\": \"What machine learning tools have you used? Give a concrete example.\",\n      \"evaluation_criteria\": [\"maîtrise technique\", \"exemples concrets\", \"profondeur\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"weight\": 3.0,\n      \"max_duration_seconds\": 90,\n      \"question_ar\": \"كيف تتعامل مع البيانات المفقودة في مجموعة بيانات؟\",\n      \"question_fr\": \"Comment gérez-vous les données manquantes dans un jeu de données ?\",\n      \"question_en\": \"How do you handle missing data in a dataset?\",\n      \"evaluation_criteria\": [\"méthodes\", \"justification\", \"expérience pratique\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Toutes les questions ont max_duration_seconds=90 (1 min 30 s).\nPoids : Q1=×1, Q2=×2, Q3=×3 → moyenne pondérée."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Position — Full Stack (poids uniformes, 90 s)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('position_id', j._id);"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/positions",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Développeur Full Stack\",\n  \"department\": \"IT\",\n  \"location\": \"Tunis\",\n  \"is_active\": true,\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"weight\": 1.0,\n      \"max_duration_seconds\": 90,\n      \"question_ar\": \"قدم نفسك وأخبرني عن تجربتك في تطوير الويب.\",\n      \"question_fr\": \"Présentez-vous et parlez de votre expérience en développement web.\",\n      \"question_en\": \"Introduce yourself and talk about your web development experience.\",\n      \"evaluation_criteria\": [\"clarté\", \"expérience\", \"motivation\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"weight\": 1.0,\n      \"max_duration_seconds\": 90,\n      \"question_ar\": \"ما هي الأطر التقنية التي تعمل بها؟\",\n      \"question_fr\": \"Quels frameworks utilisez-vous ? Donnez un exemple concret.\",\n      \"question_en\": \"What frameworks do you use? Give a concrete project example.\",\n      \"evaluation_criteria\": [\"maîtrise technique\", \"exemples concrets\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"weight\": 1.0,\n      \"max_duration_seconds\": 90,\n      \"question_ar\": \"كيف تتعامل مع أداء التطبيق؟\",\n      \"question_fr\": \"Comment gérez-vous les problèmes de performance d'une application ?\",\n      \"question_en\": \"How do you handle application performance issues?\",\n      \"evaluation_criteria\": [\"méthodes\", \"outils\", \"expérience\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Positions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/interviews/positions?skip=0&limit=20&sort_by=created_at&order=desc",
              "host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["interviews","positions"],
              "query":[{"key":"skip","value":"0"},{"key":"limit","value":"20"},{"key":"sort_by","value":"created_at"},{"key":"order","value":"desc"}]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Position by ID",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Chaque question a weight et max_duration_seconds', () => {",
              "  j.questions.forEach((q,i) => {",
              "    pm.expect(q.weight, `Q${i+1} weight`).to.be.a('number');",
              "    pm.expect(q.max_duration_seconds, `Q${i+1} max_duration`).to.be.a('number');",
              "  });",
              "});",
              "j.questions.forEach(q => console.log(`  Q${q.order} weight=${q.weight} max=${q.max_duration_seconds}s`));"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/positions/{{position_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Distinct Departments",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/positions/meta/departments",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Position",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/positions/{{position_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "04 — Sessions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Session (accès immédiat)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.session_id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', j.session_id);",
              "  console.log('session_id:', j.session_id);",
              "  console.log('created_by:', j.created_by);",
              "  console.log('expires_at:', j.expires_at);",
              "}"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"{{candidate_id}}\",\n  \"job_position_id\": \"{{position_id}}\",\n  \"language\": \"fr\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Session (avec schedule)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "if (j.session_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', j.session_id);"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"{{candidate_id}}\",\n  \"job_position_id\": \"{{position_id}}\",\n  \"language\": \"fr\",\n  \"scheduled_at\": \"2026-03-25T10:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Session by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/{{session_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Sessions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions?skip=0&limit=20",
              "host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["interviews","sessions"],
              "query":[{"key":"skip","value":"0"},{"key":"limit","value":"20"},{"key":"status","value":"pending","disabled":true}]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Session Answers (avec weight)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "let totalW = 0, sumSW = 0;",
              "j.forEach(a => {",
              "  const w = a.weight || 1.0, s = a.score || 0;",
              "  totalW += w; sumSW += s * w;",
              "  console.log(`  Q${a.question_order} score=${s}/10 weight=${w} max_duration=voir position`);",
              "});",
              "if (totalW > 0) console.log('Moyenne pondérée:', (sumSW/totalW).toFixed(2), '/10');"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/{{session_id}}/answers",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Session Answers Summary",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('average_score présent', () => pm.expect(j.average_score).to.be.a('number'));",
              "console.log('average_score (pondéré):', j.average_score, '/10');",
              "console.log('evaluated:', j.evaluated_count, '/', j.total_answers);"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/{{session_id}}/answers/summary",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Sessions by Candidate",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/candidate/{{candidate_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Schedule / Reschedule Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/{{session_id}}/schedule?scheduled_at=2026-03-25T10:00:00Z",
              "host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["interviews","sessions","{{session_id}}","schedule"],
              "query":[{"key":"scheduled_at","value":"2026-03-25T10:00:00Z"}]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Session Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/{{session_id}}/status?status=cancelled",
              "host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["interviews","sessions","{{session_id}}","status"],
              "query":[{"key":"status","value":"cancelled"}]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "description": "Statuts valides : pending | in_progress | completed | cancelled\nstatus=completed → notification automatique."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions/{{session_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "05 — Evaluations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Trigger Evaluation (manuel)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "console.log(pm.response.json().message);"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/evaluations/trigger",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"session_id\": \"{{session_id}}\",\n  \"language\": \"fr\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Lance l'évaluation LLM en arrière-plan.\nAttendre 10-30 s puis GET /evaluations/{{session_id}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Evaluation ★ (rapport complet v4)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "// v4 : global_verdict absent",
              "pm.test('global_verdict absent', () => pm.expect(j.global_verdict).to.be.undefined);",
              "pm.test('average_score présent', () => pm.expect(j.average_score).to.be.a('number'));",
              "pm.test('recommendation non vide', () => pm.expect(j.recommendation).to.not.be.empty);",
              "pm.test('decision_reason non vide', () => pm.expect(j.decision_reason).to.not.be.empty);",
              "pm.test('summary non vide', () => pm.expect(j.summary).to.not.be.empty);",
              "pm.test('per_answer contient weight', () => {",
              "  j.per_answer.forEach((a,i) => pm.expect(a.weight, `Q${i+1}`).to.be.a('number'));",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Affichage",
              "console.log('=== RAPPORT v4 ===');",
              "console.log('Candidat      :', j.candidate_name);",
              "console.log('Poste         :', j.position_title);",
              "console.log('Score pondéré :', j.average_score, '/10  (', j.average_score*10, '/100)');",
              "console.log('Décision      :', j.decision, '→', j.decision_label, j.decision_color);",
              "console.log('Raison        :', j.decision_reason);",
              "console.log('Recommandation:', j.recommendation);",
              "console.log('Résumé        :', j.summary);",
              "console.log('Points forts  :', JSON.stringify(j.key_strengths));",
              "console.log('Améliorations :', JSON.stringify(j.key_improvements));",
              "console.log('');",
              "let totalW = 0, sumSW = 0;",
              "j.per_answer.forEach(a => {",
              "  totalW += a.weight; sumSW += a.score * a.weight;",
              "  console.log(`  Q${a.question_order} (×${a.weight}) | score=${a.score}/10 | verdict=${a.verdict}`);",
              "  if (a.had_followup) console.log(`    ↳ suivi | initial=${a.initial_score} → final=${a.score}`);",
              "});",
              "console.log('');",
              "console.log('Vérification pondérée :', (sumSW/totalW).toFixed(2), '/10 (attendu:', j.average_score, ')');"
            ]}
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/evaluations/{{session_id}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "description": "Rapport v4 :\n- `average_score` = Σ(score×weight)/Σ(weight)\n- `global_verdict` supprimé\n- `recommendation`, `decision_reason`, `summary` toujours remplis\n- `per_answer[n].weight` présent\n- `had_followup`, `initial_score` si question de suivi posée"
          }
