        {
          "name": "WebSocket — Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Utiliser l'onglet WebSocket Postman :\n  ws://localhost:8000/ws/interview/{{session_id}}?lang=fr\n\n**Messages envoyés :**\n  {\"type\": \"audio_finished\"}       ← fin lecture bienvenue/question\n  {\"type\": \"audio_chunk\", \"audio_data\": \"<base64>\"}\n  {\"type\": \"answer_complete\"}      ← fin enregistrement\n  {\"type\": \"end_interview\"}        ← annulation\n\n**Messages reçus :**\n  welcome          → audio bienvenue (chunked PCM)\n  welcome_back     → audio reprise si session in_progress (is_reconnection=true)\n  question         → audio question (max_duration, weight, progress)\n  question_loading → génération en cours\n  answer_saved     → transcription OK\n  answer_evaluated → {score, verdict, weight, feedback, needs_followup}\n  followup_question → question de suivi si score < 8\n  answer_followup_completed → score final\n  interview_completed → fin + notification déclenchée\n  global_evaluation → {average_score, decision, decision_label,\n                        decision_color, decision_reason, recommendation,\n                        key_strengths, key_improvements, summary}\n                      NB : global_verdict absent (supprimé v4)\n\n**Durée réponse :**\n  max_duration_seconds = 90 s par défaut (configurable par question)\n  Le client affiche un compte à rebours et s'arrête automatiquement."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

